<h1 id=3D"PRDUserNotificationsEmail-FeaturePositioning">Feature Positioning=
</h1>
<h2 id=3D"PRDUserNotificationsEmail-FeatureOverview">Feature Overview</h2>
<p>User Notifications feature goal is to <span>enable effective &amp; consi=
stent email communication from NBIN to Compass Users &amp; Firms users by r=
eplacing the existing legacy R2 tools and enabling common services that can=
 be leveraged across NBIN streams for Transactional, Operational, Regulator=
y &amp; Marketing&nbsp; types of communication.</span></p>
<p>This is a first step to move towards our vision of having contextual, pe=
rsonalized and effortless communication with Compass Users and Client Firms=
.</p>
<ol>
 <li data-uuid=3D"59f6301f-33a6-42bf-a184-bfb7c78c01d1">Streamlining of cli=
ent communications based on user needs &amp; preferences (i.e. help make co=
mms digestible, manageable, as-needed),&nbsp;</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"4d5e532d-e57c-41e5-a7c3-e49cbf3b0c1d">Make available a ra=
nge of channels and targeting capabilities for NBIN teams to reach their in=
tended audience effectively. - SMS, In-app notifications</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"49ff52c7-727d-4686-b5e7-11e2d31c14ee"><span style=3D"colo=
r:#000000;"><span>Automate communication tasks to reduce manual effort requ=
ired by NBIN teams.</span></span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"a1408f94-aed2-4478-bdec-0b5a270956fe"><span style=3D"colo=
r:#000000;"><span>Enabling common services to support firm- centered commun=
ication.</span></span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"cf6dcee0-d4b7-4c39-825d-be90ebc1028b"><span style=3D"colo=
r:#000000;"><span>Enabling common services to support communication for eng=
agement channels</span></span></li>
</ol>
<h2 id=3D"PRDUserNotificationsEmail-ProblemStatement">Problem Statement</h2=
>
<p>The way we manage client communications today is complex, labor-intensiv=
e, and at times ineffective for clients to consume.&nbsp; As we continue to=
 transition more to our platform where new capabilities like real-time, in-=
app notifications are supported, there is a significant opportunity for imp=
roving relevancy, timeliness, and effectiveness of&nbsp; user communication=
.&nbsp;</p>
<p>Key reasons for working on this now (2026):</p>
<ol>
 <li data-uuid=3D"63848c36-74b6-40c5-ac58-4025683ddf53">Support the organiz=
ational goal of converging into a single platform navigation by end of 2026=
:=20
  <ol>
   <li data-uuid=3D"c60c6fb1-e889-4f59-b0ff-8af8894b68ff">Requires critical=
 legacy platform functions to be migrated, including the replacement of ema=
il notifications utility for users and existing in-app channels</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"fca0fa6f-2716-4515-9867-335e7ef47929">Requires specific=
ally the system health status + related notifications to be fully supported=
 by end of Q2, when most Tools &amp; Apps will be migrated to new Compass</=
li>
  </ol></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"d764da84-073e-450b-9416-7ff791b971be">Two platform naviga=
tion leading to user overload and impacting client satisfaction and user ex=
perience<br>
  <ol>
   <li data-uuid=3D"0882d02b-f720-4143-9de7-6f2da17b3091">Multiple clicks r=
equired for the user to subscribe/unsubscribe to email notifications and ac=
cess announcements through bulletins.</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"a341a6da-4d76-4830-8c3c-386958ace162">Inconsistent user=
 experience between CX and R2 with regards to system health communication w=
ithin the application</li>
  </ol></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"c0f23804-63e8-407b-9dce-d8d0370f1570">Growing inefficienc=
ies for NBIN teams specifically around product-related release / outage com=
munications across two platforms, which is unsustainable</li>
</ol>
<h3 id=3D"PRDUserNotificationsEmail-CurrentLandscape-EmailNotifications">Cu=
rrent Landscape - Email Notifications</h3>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"16ce7a0a-bef7-4eb1-b459-a59f9a3cc5a1">Email is the primar=
y channel used by NBIN teams for communication with Compass users and Clien=
t Firms</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"15f92e71-7bbe-440b-802d-fa1c2b785a81">Limited in-app noti=
fications channels and primarily managed through application status and cli=
ent bulletins</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"f5c50485-bec7-4995-8f87-c48fe151e40c">We have system driv=
en email notifications primarily from Legacy as well as manual communicatio=
n triggered by NBIN teams</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"4c461022-ed44-4641-9383-4b649f56f042">Notification prefer=
ences are managed in Compass Legacy. (for Legacy apps only)</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"791fcea7-bbb1-4c30-b125-6fb3432aaa23">High-level types em=
ail communications at NBIN</li>
</ul>
