ties&amp;FrictionsinCurrentCXProcesses">Vulnerabilities &amp; Frictions in =
Current CX Processes</h3>
<p>Reference to full user journey and pain point analysis -&nbsp;<a href=3D=
"/spaces/COMPASS/pages/2285907955/2.+Journey+Map+-+Notifications#id-2.Journ=
eyMapNotifications-2.JourneyMapNotifications-JourneyMap-NotificationCommuni=
cation"> Journey Map - Notifications#2.JourneyMapNotifications-JourneyMap-N=
otificationCommunication</a></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 82=
.717%;">
  <colgroup>
   <col style=3D"width: 11.5748%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 19.9398%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 27.2348%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 19.9398%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 21.2913%;">
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh"><br></th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Email Subscription</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Content &amp; Template Managem=
ent=E2=86=92</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Email Orchestration=E2=86=92</=
th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Email Service</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Current CX Activities&nbsp;</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"bc710587-1e09-4d88-9846-ec88a42ff704">CX users need =
to opt-in for emails notifications through R2</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"4c45252a-6e12-4272-aed0-df888db7a25b">NPAT tool used=
 for template management and targeting rules</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"ca282908-86eb-46dc-ab1a-497e66b08cc7">Emails from NB=
IN communications follow organization guidelines&nbsp;</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"3a8d81c1-ce92-4caa-abc5-1a5306a1d110">Orchestration =
is managed through the one click database</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"9386ab8e-7e39-4924-a246-c1ae17941eab">The jobs are s=
plit between two services - published notifications, targeted notifications=
.</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"e0e4772d-6693-4108-8daa-abdb41bb3f53">Windows server=
 based server used for emails</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Friction &amp; Pain Points</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul style=3D"text-align: left;">
      <li data-uuid=3D"b5dbac94-e5d9-4706-bdd7-0c335764a5cd">Lack of awaren=
ess for email subscription feature among users.</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"2abb6c6a-6600-4f70-9210-bbeccb0a743f">Client distrib=
ution list being maintained offline and hence not consumed by legacy email =
service.</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"306a7124-ec17-4d48-bded-348f54007930">Unable to use =
legacy services for onboarding CX notifications (App status)</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"8312fc45-12bf-457d-8520-567472119578"><span style=3D=
"color:#333333;">Bulletins<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style=3D"color:#3=
33333;">don=E2=80=99t</span><span style=3D"color:#333333;"><span>&nbsp;</sp=
an>support<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style=3D"color:#333333;">targeted=
 comms and<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style=3D"color:#333333;">hence ma=
nual email channels<span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style=3D"color:#333333;"=
>need to be used</span></li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"e2061f7c-033e-482e-8849-a77af94a33c9">We are unable =
to onboard CX notifications through this service</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"fd86fbb3-e61a-4aa2-8cce-cc2c5b95e63d">Service reache=
d end of life and needs to be decommissioned to address security vulnerabil=
ity</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"f8add7d4-f63f-4be8-9752-e998322deee9">Limited analyt=
ics capabilities</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Lessons learned from legacy services</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"58b62ada-1823-4077-9b7d-4270d1851549"><span>For new =
users all R2 </span><span>notifications are opted out by&nbsp;</span><span>=
default instead of default opt-in</span></li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"56ba3a41-4278-4d91-879f-770387b39bbe">Limited in-app=
 communication capabilities and presents an opportunity for building new ca=
pabilities.</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"0793e2f7-01d0-4ab2-ba48-e4a91f7d9d21">Services needs=
 to consume events from multiple sources</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"5c071f67-c14e-468a-9de8-6e42e878cae7">Rule based tar=
geting must have for successful orchestration service</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"452ad8d2-a4d8-4628-85f1-f065cabce587">Service needs =
to be more modern as expanded to multiple channels</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h2 id=3D"PRDUserNotificationsEmail-BenefitsHypothesis">Benefits Hypothesis=
</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 87=
.5402%;">
  <colgroup>
   <col style=3D"width: 10.2009%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 7.35197%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 7.90337%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 74.5254%;">
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Dimension</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Reach</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Impact</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Rationale</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Score (1-7)</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">6</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">3</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Client</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">7</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">3</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"d7b31339-0286-46ff-846a-5023a465dd72">Affects all cl=
ients</li>
      <li class=3D"fontSize-child textColor-child paragraph-child" data-uui=
d=3D"2cb42868-5145-4c2a-ae86-563944dc3687">
       <p><span style=3D"color:#000000;"><span>Reduce Email Overload - In-a=
pp communication capabilities open up a new channel for communication and a=
llows users to access all communication within a centralized location in CX=
.&nbsp; This also allows us to eliminate the need for email distribution wh=
ere it is suboptimal / not the correct channel (e.g. what's changing, plann=
ed maintenances)</span></span></p></li>
      <li class=3D"fontSize-child textColor-child paragraph-child" data-uui=
d=3D"3dd49a87-82d2-44d2-a88c-c2e4eb3ed9dc">
       <p><span style=3D"color:#000000;"><span>User Efficiency: personalize=
d communication and classification of communication allows user to easily l=
ocate details without missing any critical communication thereby increasing=
 user efficiency. </span></span></p></li>
      <li class=3D"fontSize-child textColor-child paragraph-child" data-uui=
d=3D"e10138f7-da8d-412e-8646-4957390479a8">
       <p><span style=3D"color:#000000;"><span>Task prioritization - Allows=
 users to easily prioritize tasks due to the ability to differentiate and i=
dentify time sensitive tasks</span></span></p></li>
      <li class=3D"fontSize-child textColor-child paragraph-child" data-uui=
d=3D"76d081b2-3b2a-41ed-b98a-30446160a883">
       <p><span style=3D"color:#000000;"><span>Awareness - Allows users to =
be aware of all latest information and updates due to consistency and impro=
vements in communications from NBIN</span></span></p></li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Financial</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">-</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">2</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li class=3D"fontSize-child textColor-child paragraph-child" data-uui=
d=3D"04dc762a-ba81-40a1-973f-914fc700221e">
       <p><span style=3D"color:#000000;"><span>User Engagement: Enables us =
to increase user engagement thereby increasing CX adoption.</span></span></=
p></li>
      <li class=3D"fontSize-child textColor-child paragraph-child" data-uui=
d=3D"35472218-e0dd-462d-acef-3f523564d202">
       <p><span style=3D"color:#000000;"><span>CSAT: This feature would res=
ult in increased customer satisfaction and communication has been a pain po=
int for our clients for long.</span></span></p></li>
      <li class=3D"fontSize-child textColor-child paragraph-child" data-uui=
d=3D"35035564-6636-4b27-bccd-62bce091da67">
       <p><span style=3D"color:#000000;"><span>Cost Savings: Decom legacy t=
ools and bring consistency across all NBIN communications. Eliminate dual-m=
aintenance on system-related comms.</span></span></p></li>
      <li class=3D"fontSize-child textColor-child paragraph-child" data-uui=
d=3D"a4cb3aa1-b8dd-4a7b-90cb-5c97745b3bb6">
       <p><span style=3D"color:#000000;"><span>Automation - Reduce manual e=
fforts across NBIN teams</span></span></p></li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Risk</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">-</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">2</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"1129ad16-e69b-4ab7-a17a-d6410d3d0faf">Security vulne=
rabilities - Must have feature to decommission R2 services and address secu=
rity vulnerabilities associated with legacy platforms</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Employee</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">2</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">6</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li class=3D"fontSize-child textColor-child paragraph-child" data-uui=
d=3D"513df523-9e18-4049-99d5-87237e0997a7">
       <p><span style=3D"color:#000000;"><span>Enhanced capabilities: Abili=
ty to support new use cases which are current capabilities don't support (i=
n-app communication, targeted, personalized communication)</span></span></p=
></li>
      <li class=3D"fontSize-child textColor-child paragraph-child" data-uui=
d=3D"98383256-3b4d-4b11-a391-088b8f3515cb"><span style=3D"color:#000000;"><=
span>Automation- Reduce manual efforts across NBIN teams</span></span></li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
