<h2 id=3D"PRDUserNotificationsEmail-FeatureObjectives&amp;Metrics">Feature =
Objectives &amp; Metrics</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped relative-table confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 87=
.8617%;">
  <colgroup>
   <col style=3D"width: 4.48627%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 38.0875%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 57.4079%;">
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh"><br></th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Feature Goal</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">KPI</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>1</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><span>Replace the legacy email notification services and migrate ex=
isting notifications to the new service</span></p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"aca53feb-1705-4dfe-b72f-c4f1d2721f86">All email noti=
fications to be driven basis CX user profile</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"fa775daf-e66b-4c18-a944-f6709e8a275a">Decommission l=
egacy windows email server, NPAT tool for email templating &amp; orchestrat=
ion services for event generation</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">2</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Enable NBIN teams to onboard new email notif=
ications seamlessly</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"23ffcffe-8e00-492f-8519-34491754c514">Enable new not=
ifications from CX - Application Status</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"b6e882bf-f793-44e9-9cfe-f29a531017ac">Operationalize=
 new notification onboarding and maintenance of notifications.</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">3</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Support long-term NBIN strategy of having om=
nichannel communication</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"1fa7a89c-10c9-4dde-a4b7-343feab9482e">Reusable capab=
ilities which support future enhancements</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<p><br></p>
<h2 id=3D"PRDUserNotificationsEmail-TargetAudience">Target Audience</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 87=
.8617%;">
  <colgroup>
   <col style=3D"width: 19.5948%;">
