   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Clients - Advisor &amp; specialist roles</p>
     <p><br></p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"e2b81477-477c-40e5-8c96-967f2b3c5005">Want to quickl=
y execute their tasks but are active on Compass for only a few hours in a d=
ay</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"48db47d0-96b3-45fd-85ba-36bc5cfc5821">In some cases =
Compass users don't login everyday but want to know if there is any update =
or change in status</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"7db1d8c8-9ae3-47ad-9209-ae904c8c4a66">CX users shoul=
d seamlessly be able to opt-in or opt-out out of email notifications basis =
their individual needs</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"bce7ca36-9baa-489b-8a2d-2dc5325f14d5">CX users shoul=
d to receive timely notifications which improve their work efficiency</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"ecbc39a8-3de9-4b34-bc26-cb96e311ac91">CX users shoul=
d easily be able to identify the criticality, time sensitivity and expected=
 action of each communication</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Clients - Firm Admins</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"3ded36c3-4fa7-46dc-9e8b-005138bc9133">For larger IB =
firms the firm admins want to be gatekeeper for all communication sent to a=
dvisors</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"b21042a4-fcb8-4b43-aec6-0c9b6dbf036e">Admins want ad=
vance intimation of new launches</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"f1dcbf3d-2071-48a0-b861-f0824ee06cab">Admins want to=
 know about regulatory and compliance changes first</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>NBIN Teams -Product,&nbsp; Support &amp; Communications</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"9a346da7-d8bf-4e96-8cee-d976d652c013">Increase user =
engagement and Compass adoption</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"8ec5cadc-ee3a-4dba-9b28-7dd3dd8a9491">Reduce manual =
overload associated with email management</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"17edd8dc-8822-4c5c-93e8-2b78b0a45213">Capabilities t=
hat allow NBIN teams to modify existing and introduce new notifications</li=
>
      <li data-uuid=3D"add75452-f72b-4ab4-b838-9b278e95c139">Self-serve cap=
ability that enable setting up templates and rules for communication</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>NBIN Teams - Service</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"37fa9d63-f856-4012-b79c-9287fcc3daa6">Want clients t=
o have self-serve capabilities&nbsp;</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"7f5aedd5-217c-4417-b6e5-2b68fd0f82af">Want lower que=
ries received from clients by providing upfront and accessible communicatio=
n</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"af326534-2c0f-49e0-a3a5-6f6188ae0e18">Service teams =
