<h1 id=3D"PRDUserNotificationsEmail-FeatureScope">Feature Scope</h1>
<h2 id=3D"PRDUserNotificationsEmail-InScope">In Scope</h2>
<ul>
 <li class=3D"paragraph-child" data-uuid=3D"7a4c6405-7dd8-4f8d-9576-7be28be=
c2d9e">
  <p><span>List of email notifications that are available today in R2 -&nbs=
p;<a data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"2230202561" data-linked-resource-=
container-version=3D"29" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"application/v=
nd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet" data-linked-resource-=
default-alias=3D"Email Prferences- R2.xlsx" data-linked-resource-id=3D"2230=
202649" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-versi=
on=3D"1" data-nice-type=3D"Excel Spreadsheet" href=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca/d=
ownload/attachments/2230202561/Email%20Prferences-%20R2.xlsx?version=3D1&am=
p;modificationDate=3D1744810586946&amp;api=3Dv2" rel=3D"nofollow">Email Pre=
ferences- R2.xlsx</a></span></p></li>
 <li class=3D"paragraph-child" data-uuid=3D"3ad4cfbe-85a6-47e3-9ff5-e07c356=
29c61">
  <p><span>Users have an option to select the services for which they would=
 like to receive email notifications, change the email id on which notifica=
tions are received and ability to stop notifications during vacation.</span=
></p></li>
 <li class=3D"paragraph-child" data-uuid=3D"29aae0ab-e397-414f-9d42-4a97ec3=
c6650"><span>Following notifications are not mentioned in the above list bu=
t are currently available and opted-in by default- Option Commission, Optio=
ns Positions, Account Transfers &amp; re-org notifications</span></li>
 <li class=3D"paragraph-child" data-uuid=3D"60cb8f86-9a5a-40e0-a6e2-c277d07=
5bb6b"><span>R2 classifies notifications into Services - any publication, b=
ulletins etc or Targeted - notifications where RR code ranges are checked p=
rior to triggering notifications</span></li>
 <li class=3D"paragraph-child" data-uuid=3D"248e4477-9ff6-4f7c-8a25-4b883c2=
5af00"><span>For targeted notifications there are three recipients - Compas=
s users' basis their respective RR range, Firm specialist users with firm R=
R range, Firm admin roles -&nbsp;<a data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"22=
30202561" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"29" data-linked-resourc=
e-content-type=3D"application/pdf" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"NB=
CN Portal - Specialist Roles.pdf" data-linked-resource-id=3D"2285896977" da=
ta-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" d=
ata-nice-type=3D"PDF Document" href=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca/download/attachm=
ents/2230202561/NBCN%20Portal%20-%20Specialist%20Roles.pdf?version=3D1&amp;=
modificationDate=3D1748896493534&amp;api=3Dv2" rel=3D"nofollow">NBCN Portal=
 - Specialist Roles.pdf</a>.</span></li>
 <li class=3D"paragraph-child" data-uuid=3D"a88b64ad-8c9c-4a05-b177-51ea20c=
292d3"><span>Targeted notifications access data from AS400 (maturing instru=
ment, DRIP, Option position, Account transfer) or R1 (re-org notifications,=
 tax correction) or MQ messages generated by iMost (GDI notifications) or r=
equest status (file upload)</span></li>
 <li class=3D"paragraph-child" data-uuid=3D"6c86f515-5078-472a-94ce-2c9b83a=
5a297">Replacement of NPAT NBIN Portal (One-click) used to maintain message=
 templates and rules for the email notifications. -&nbsp;<a href=3D"https:/=
/wiki.bnc.ca/spaces/COMPASS/pages/2285907911/5.+Use+Cases+-+Notifications" =
rel=3D"nofollow">5. Use Cases - Notifications - NBIN Product Team - Conflue=
nce</a></li>
 <li class=3D"paragraph-child" data-uuid=3D"730f5f0b-31cf-4aa2-8845-991c0af=
db91f">Existing capabilities - Context Passing, Option to unsubscribe, Link=
s etc.</li>
 <li class=3D"paragraph-child" data-uuid=3D"53f8f059-3a75-4e70-bf54-cfda17c=
8eccf">Capability map to support notification communication</li>
 <li class=3D"paragraph-child" data-uuid=3D"ff51ddfa-5aaf-4f42-86fd-07106ed=
9533e"><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-=
manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-external-re=
source" draggable=3D"false" height=3D"250" src=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca/downl=
oad/attachments/2528690799/image-2026-6-11_11-1-37.png?version=3D1&amp;modi=
ficationDate=3D1781190097899&amp;api=3Dv2" data-image-src=3D"https://wiki.b=
nc.ca/download/attachments/2528690799/image-2026-6-11_11-1-37.png?version=
=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1781190097899&amp;api=3Dv2"></span></li>
</ul>
<p><br></p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"1705e3e2-2ec7-4cec-b3d0-553693384f4d">Architecture - <a h=
ref=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca/spaces/NA/pages/2769069803/CX+Orchestration+for+=
Notifications" rel=3D"nofollow">CX Orchestration for Notifications - NBIN A=
rchitecture - Confluence</a></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"f9364c6c-0a3d-40a1-b928-15f122a35f2c">Design -&nbsp;<span=
> <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://www.figma.com/design/9qWagiUVC=
uXD74OL3iuwg0/Feature-Notifications?node-id=3D90-6733&amp;t=3DQTVgONIboZmQA=
PCF-1" rel=3D"nofollow">https://www.figma.com/design/9qWagiUVCuXD74OL3iuwg0=
/Feature-Notifications?node-id=3D90-6733&amp;t=3DQTVgONI=E2=80=A6</a></span=
><span> PW: FeatNotification</span></li>
</ul>
<h2 id=3D"PRDUserNotificationsEmail-OutofScope">Out of Scope</h2>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"212e619d-d0f4-4adc-8a72-d97e09b9f46e">Content management =
system decommission</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"aecfff49-bf60-4080-b5cc-418f5b963124">Notifications to NB=
F users is out of scope for this feature</li>
</ul>
<h2 id=3D"PRDUserNotificationsEmail-KeyAssumptions">Key Assumptions</h2>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"998bc842-1401-44dd-8f7b-4ea88916929c">Multi-firm feature =
would be implemented in CX to ensure RR range consistencies between CX and =
R2 profiles. This is required for successful migration of notifications to =
CX profile</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"f290756d-32a6-4710-8273-fd2b56ba5a06">Email-id is consist=
ent between R2 and CX user profiles and hence users will continue to receiv=
e emails on the same email id as they do today</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"c0307c8f-3cea-4cad-9a19-e51471dae783">Users with speciali=
st roles in R2 can be identified in CX&nbsp;</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"8d37489a-1cbb-4199-b327-15fb1507ed68">This feature will p=
rovide common capabilities and services which will support future roadmap o=
f additional channels and additional notifications</li>
</ul>
<h2 id=3D"PRDUserNotificationsEmail-KeyDependencies">Key Dependencies</h2>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"7cfc9f56-63fe-4ff6-88a1-9f6b143089ba">Email service/API f=
or CX will be approved in Q4</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"a28d9a4e-5b34-4e39-8168-d71e8c12999e">Email orchestration=
 will have capabilities to pass events to any Email service that the organi=
zation decides to go further with.</li>
</ul>
<h1 id=3D"PRDUserNotificationsEmail-FeatureRequirements">Feature Requiremen=
ts</h1>
<p><br></p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"15b2aa7b-bf17-433d-bafe-bc009d40a743">Address gaps observ=
ed in the user journey - <a href=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca/spaces/COMPASS/page=
s/2230202561/1.+Communication+Touchpoints" rel=3D"nofollow">1. Communicatio=
n Touchpoints - NBIN Product Team - Confluence</a>&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
<p><br></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 10=
88.0px;">
  <colgroup>
   <col style=3D"width: 191.0px;">
   <col style=3D"width: 896.0px;">
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th colspan=3D"2" style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=
=3D"confluenceTh">
     <h2 id=3D"PRDUserNotificationsEmail-1-EmailOrchestration">1 - Email Or=
chestration</h2></th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Th">Problems to Solve</th>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Enable common services that allow orchestration&nbsp; transactional=
, operational, marketing notifications to NBIN clients and CX users through=
 email channels and at the same time support future strategy of omnichannel=
 notification communication.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Th">Target Users</th>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Clients- CX users</p>
     <p>NBIN Product &amp; Support Teams</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Th">Requirements</th>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <ol>
      <li data-uuid=3D"8d13ed5c-1af3-439f-9ee6-a1f85699eeee">Email orchestr=
ation to allow targeting for events basis the following parameters=20
       <ol>
        <li data-uuid=3D"8f654c7d-c4c7-4e26-b880-d01bdce2180d">User access =
&amp; permissions - RR range, SZ zone ids, firm, firm type, CX role, featur=
e access</li>
        <li data-uuid=3D"a4979938-090e-4eca-8007-ce8c0b3968b1">User activit=
y - requestor, approvers</li>
        <li data-uuid=3D"5e19d049-f8b9-4610-8178-cbcf38354961">User prefere=
nces - subscription to email notifications, vacation back-ups.</li>
       </ol></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"5f22fbdb-21c8-4b46-b27a-272a8436d224">Email orchestr=
ation acts as a rule engine and allows setup of configurable rules</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"09478754-d088-49f7-88a6-c97c8cf8a4aa">Should be able=
 to consume events from multiple sources (ex - MQ or external teams, CX fea=
tures like Applications status, other sources within the bank like AS400)</=
li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"52106636-e363-4780-a2bd-a7c6efca3fb1">Enable classif=
ication of events into categories based on rules defined by NBIN teams. (ex=
 - based on the notification type- active, passive, critical, time sensitiv=
e or basis the CX capability - asset servicing, account or client servicing=
 etc.</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"42ed5625-8ba3-4a90-9d81-81989e587176">Enable aggrega=
tion &amp; merging of multiple events in the same category or across catego=
ries for the purpose of email notifications&nbsp;</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"598e088c-c8e7-4ca6-9c6b-77e16a592ea4">Enable an even=
t store which can record and maintain history of events for future roadmap =
features (in-app notifications)</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"e6552e46-24ab-40b9-9ee1-e2badfea7829">Enable enrichm=
ent of events with additional information and attributes (ex- account id or=
 client name or status etc)</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"e1730fe0-0846-4d4d-83bd-b7fcfffc02ec">Enable this fe=
ature to feed into various communication services like email api or in-app =
notifications and support=20
       <ol>
        <li data-uuid=3D"c7e09085-8b33-4e92-af18-9f549390fae2">Frequency - =
single event, aggregation, batch</li>
        <li data-uuid=3D"dfa21579-b5ce-4ed3-8b67-fc2138c243fe">Timing - rea=
l time, scheduled time basis rules set by NBIN.</li>
       </ol></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"5220e534-fdb1-47cc-8ce8-3eb1e42c0acd">Enable persona=
lization=20
       <ol>
        <li data-uuid=3D"86112be6-9480-48b5-b29f-6e96e97b1ecd">Templates - =
trigger templates basis role/firm/firm type&nbsp;</li>
        <li data-uuid=3D"58347a02-a92d-477d-b707-97bd84b23600">Preference -=
 language( EN or FR)</li>
       </ol></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"a2ebf784-37b7-414c-93b3-eeffe7b81aed">Ability to man=
ge User lifecycle scenarios on T+0/T+1 (synchronization)=20
       <ol>
        <li data-uuid=3D"4a8d5fa3-6ff7-4a59-83e7-5269dd4136fc">New user opt=
s-in to notifications</li>
        <li data-uuid=3D"c65333c5-ed23-4bc5-85bd-0cf6a12620c1">Deactivation=
 of existing users who are subscribed to notifications</li>
        <li data-uuid=3D"ac54d7ad-0ccf-4a32-9a9f-a875440e2e05">Change in em=
ail address of existing users subscribed to notifications</li>
        <li data-uuid=3D"e8825806-9ec4-4c89-8086-1ad9d5aa6e3d">Change in ro=
le / rr range / secured zone id of existing user subscribed to notification=
s</li>
       </ol></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"66aab4ae-0ad1-40b5-a5fa-5644979e1b42">Ability to man=
age Notification lifecycle scenarios on T+0/T+1 (synchronization)=20
       <ol>
        <li data-uuid=3D"af05b6cc-4996-49c9-bdc0-fe5989893f16">User opting =
in for a notification</li>
        <li data-uuid=3D"4ed5cdd3-5fb1-483e-9800-211af09e10aa">User opting =
out for a notification</li>
       </ol></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"1234dbad-3dc7-4c9c-84e1-48b89b8387f0">Ability to man=
age the account/client scenarios on T+0 or T+1 (synchronization)=20
       <ol>
        <li data-uuid=3D"e5335f76-2cbc-436f-9eeb-293b55630d10">Events gener=
ated for account ids/client ids opened today</li>
        <li data-uuid=3D"22941426-c19b-4306-9bf5-735ddb14ea22">Events gener=
ated for account ids/client ids closed/restricted today</li>
       </ol></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"bd558993-2cf8-4c2c-9a19-138b67fe4e7e">Ability to hav=
e data extracts of events managed under the orchestration services</li>
     </ol></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Th">Non-Functionals</th>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"04fbaeed-2440-456a-a526-a8613693a45d">Orchestration =
services should support 5-6 times of current volumes which is around 120k e=
mails per month.</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"6ce9ad0b-ecc2-4580-b893-68fdebe7d3b2">Support 8-10 t=
imes of existing notification types which is ~25 (count) as per current sta=
te</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"35c130f6-cca9-44c5-96bb-661d98d28dc9">Mechanism to i=
dentify duplicate events</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Th">Out of Scope</th>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"9c78687f-97dd-4c7d-bee9-a8611ebf38ef">Content manage=
ment decommission or client bulletins</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"fd14263f-2acc-4733-a07e-4b88cc529358">Future roadmap=
 items- email attachments, actual implementation of SMS and In-app channels=
, secured messaging</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"3459147d-67dd-4cdf-8002-d860294a7722">Notifications =
for NBF users is out of scope for this feature</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Th">Acceptance Criteria</th>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"b699299f-4653-4b20-94c5-a9ed5226ceb4">Existing R2 no=
tifications (<span>&nbsp;<a data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"2230202561=
" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"29" data-linked-resource-conten=
t-type=3D"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet=
" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"Email Prferences- R2.xlsx" data-lin=
ked-resource-id=3D"2230202649" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" dat=
a-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-nice-type=3D"Excel Spreadsheet" href=
=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca/download/attachments/2230202561/Email%20Prferences-=
%20R2.xlsx?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1744810586946&amp;api=3Dv2" r=
el=3D"nofollow">Email Preferences- R2.xlsx</a>)</span> orchestration is suc=
cessfully migrated and based on CX user profile and decommission the existi=
ng services -&nbsp;</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"8bdb9f0f-79ed-4d19-a522-000a3a74d12d">Ability to enh=
ance the R2 notifications with additional rules and data attributes</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"1ba1cc97-8f4b-4ccf-a30d-896d5a4fb23b">Ability to set=
up orchestration for new notifications - CX Application Status</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"608de16c-1c49-407a-a33b-989f6ddb6cba">Operationalize=
 new notifications onboarding with clear defined steps and responsibilities=
</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"a47b5c86-7943-4fe0-9953-88262c245348">Operationalize=
 modifications or decommission of onboarded notifications for orchestration=
 with clear defined steps and responsibilities</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Th">Roadmap Dependencies</th>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"16aaa582-6d7f-44f5-80f1-1555bcbca900">Dependency on =
Email subscription experience and Email Service integration to go live.</li=
>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Th">Risks &amp; Constraints</th>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"b7cdb5f3-10c0-4808-8577-cd5cf01439ab">Orchestration =
services will need to work with the email service that will be finalized in=
 the future from the following options/&nbsp;=20
       <ul>
        <li data-uuid=3D"2f069acb-1a95-437c-9afe-028687513497"><span>Use Na=
tional Bank Marketing team solution =E2=80=93 central&nbsp;</span><span>ins=
tance of Amazon SES</span><span>=E2=80=8B</span></li>
        <li data-uuid=3D"a9447b3f-301a-40b6-ac26-895b47ae116f"><span>Dedica=
ted instance for NBIN - Amazon SES/ </span><span>Sendgrid</span><span>, </s=
pan><span>SMTP server</span></li>
       </ul></li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Th">Key Assumptions</th>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"870274ef-326c-442b-b86d-a437a8ed9c24">Multi-firm fea=
ture would be implemented in CX to ensure RR range consistencies between CX=
 and R2 profiles. This is required for successful migration of notification=
s to CX profile</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"75b9abb8-9b99-43b3-bfff-f2bb5f7f7808">Email-id is co=
nsistent between R2 and CX user profiles and hence users will continue to r=
eceive emails on the same email id as they do today</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"7eed92ae-82ac-4386-8c5b-8f10a07d6bb5">Users with spe=
cialist roles in R2 can be identified in CX&nbsp;</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"5d849abd-08ef-4a16-b97c-ee38e3afaafc">This feature w=
ill provide common capabilities and services which will support future road=
map of additional channels and additional notifications</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<p><br></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 10=
86.0px;">
  <colgroup>
   <col style=3D"width: 195.0px;">
   <col style=3D"width: 891.0px;">
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th colspan=3D"2" style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=
=3D"confluenceTh">
     <h2 id=3D"PRDUserNotificationsEmail-2-EmailSubscriptionExperience">2 -=
 Email Subscription Experience</h2></th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Th">Problems to Solve</th>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">Enable users to define and modify their preferences for notifications i=
n CX</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Th">Target Users</th>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">All CX users</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Th">Requirements</th>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <ol>
      <li data-uuid=3D"f196def7-9f78-4675-af58-02b21ea9c4e1">Enable CX user=
s to opt-in or opt-out of one or more email notifications</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"4ed461ab-7840-48fc-8dc0-0a4f3c50d4f3">Enable NBIN te=
ams to define the default scenario at a user/role/firm level=20
       <ol>
        <li data-uuid=3D"34d8ff78-c7e3-4e52-80af-a4a422c9c1ac">For new user=
s whether email notifications are opt-in or opt-out by default. Users will =
have an option to modify this later.</li>
        <li data-uuid=3D"f17859d0-c7e8-45c1-8d49-0d33fbdfd4e0">During migra=
tion of existing R2 notifications. Users will have option to modify this la=
ter.</li>
       </ol></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"062d5e48-eb3c-4e49-9edf-ee304eb47e85">Enable the sub=
scription experience to support the following scenarios=20
       <ol>
        <li data-uuid=3D"dd558358-e321-4cf5-a514-06b0e96f14cb">Opt-in or op=
t-out of specific emails</li>
        <li data-uuid=3D"0af403ef-de25-4927-aa61-35ddcca360d9">Opt-in or op=
t-out of a group/category of emails</li>
        <li data-uuid=3D"02f50614-e5eb-41f7-a885-b903f8d51791">Updating pre=
ference multiple times in a day</li>
       </ol></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"1695ee24-9641-4bcc-982a-e4bd32449787">Allow user to =
additional recipients for specific emails or category of emails (ex: user i=
s on vacation)&nbsp;</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"041d7b32-d0dc-4800-a1e0-3be2db8bbf41">Orchestration =
services should be able access user preferences to determine if email notif=
ications are required</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"dcaecb70-d926-48bb-939f-2516eb28e53d">Enable NBIN ad=
mins to modify the access on behalf of users</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"d4ea32b1-6480-47f8-95e9-cfea27225297">Ability to ext=
ract report for statistics around user opt-in for email notifications</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"42b16a3a-b12d-4e3d-ba6c-950e3ff5c518">Ability to man=
ge User lifecycle scenarios on T+0/T+1=20
       <ol>
        <li>New user opts-in to notifications</li>
        <li>Deactivation of existing users who are subscribed to notificati=
ons</li>
        <li>Change in email address of existing users subscribed to notific=
ations</li>
        <li>Change in role / rr range / secured zone id of existing user su=
bscribed to notifications</li>
       </ol></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"3ed0bb36-4844-4243-9a21-2fd6cfefc040">Ability to man=
age Notification lifecycle scenarios on T+0/T+1 (synchronization)=20
       <ol>
        <li>User opting in for a notification</li>
        <li>User opting out for a notification</li>
       </ol></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"2a0dce39-b899-4534-b775-e94bbf0180a0">Ability to man=
age firm lifecycle scenarios=20
       <ol>
        <li data-uuid=3D"8d18776b-d7a9-490a-8314-dccc3351fd26">New firm bei=
ng onboarded</li>
        <li data-uuid=3D"d5e3f5cb-eac6-4908-9947-a998f7719c25">Existing fir=
m is deactivated</li>
       </ol></li>
     </ol></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Th">Non-Functionals</th>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"224c9e01-f9e2-4fd9-8cc3-8a6f85ef3f76">Feature should=
 support &gt;10 times the existing user base</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"f3743eb4-daa5-4eba-8ca6-cf37a0ec7d63">Intuitive user=
 experience to update user preferences</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Th">Out of Scope</th>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"f2742d00-7f7e-4a5a-a7e4-156155b38aa9">Content manage=
ment decommission or client bulletins</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"3a93704f-f83f-469f-bf13-a5defa2e9ec1">Future roadmap=
 items- email attachments, actual implementation of SMS and In-app channels=
, secured messaging</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"2d2d622c-9129-4bbe-8e26-f442b134af73">Notifications =
for NBF users is out of scope for this feature</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Th">Acceptance Criteria</th>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"06f29e29-4526-4670-9d78-21764deb920d">Users are able=
 to seamlessly change their email notification preferences in CX and decomm=
ission of the R2 services</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"019191f7-6299-466a-a694-fb6c46f1d0c3">Users receive =
emails notifications as per their preferences and information feeds into or=
chestration services</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Th">Roadmap Dependencies</th>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"8bb7155d-5c14-4a0c-b6a2-507148fadc03">Dependency on =
Email orchestration and Email Service integration to go live.</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Th">Risks &amp; Constraints</th>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"09235fa0-cb3a-4310-a8a9-f8e6a683d147">Email service =
is yet to be finalized</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Th">Key Assumptions</th>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"0a404d08-9095-4384-971c-29a788d117be">Multi-firm fea=
ture would be implemented in CX to ensure RR range consistencies between CX=
 and R2 profiles. This is required for successful migration of notification=
s to CX profile</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"e574d699-eaca-4c49-afda-58fe37664b3c">Email-id is co=
nsistent between R2 and CX user profiles and hence users will continue to r=
eceive emails on the same email id as they do today</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"089865b9-c387-48be-a564-fb21aceb4b79">Users with spe=
cialist roles in R2 can be identified in CX&nbsp;</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"f8e1f11a-ecad-4165-b135-28e5b24baacb">This feature w=
ill provide common capabilities and services which will support future road=
map of additional channels and additional notifications</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
