  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th colspan=3D"2" style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=
=3D"confluenceTh">
     <h2 id=3D"PRDUserNotificationsEmail-3-EmailService&amp;TemplateManagem=
ent">3 - Email Service &amp; Template Management</h2></th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Th">Problems to Solve</th>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">Integrate email service for successful delivery of transactions, market=
ing and regulatory notifications to CX user and client firms</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Th">Target Users</th>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>CX Users</p>
     <p>NBIN Teams</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Th">Requirements</th>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"363177ed-da95-4b27-ada2-43266d341a97">Compliance to =
regulatory requirements CASL - <em><strong>(TBD) - <a class=3D"external-lin=
k" href=3D"https://cbncnbccs.sharepoint.com/sites/securite/SitePages/en/Con=
sentements-%C3%A0-la-sollicitation-et-%C3%A0-la-R%C3%A9ception-de-Messages-=
%C3%89lectroniques-Commerciaux-(LCAP).aspx" rel=3D"nofollow">Procedure: Con=
sent to the Solicitation and Receipt of Commercial Electronic Messages (CAS=
L)</a></strong></em></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"1dbd2aea-8634-4881-9c03-13e183ebfb05">Service to sup=
port the domains and emails required for notifications -<em> <strong>(TBD)<=
/strong></em></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"0f94c736-dc8f-4ad2-bf14-22f6b3affde0">Ability to set=
up bilingual templates - EN/FR</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"699a9466-2e67-47d2-b43c-741b44882947">Ability to set=
up and modify email templates including<br>
       <ul>
        <li data-uuid=3D"9c88b57b-27f9-49c7-80c1-2f759fc40fb5">Email header=
 or logos</li>
        <li data-uuid=3D"1a353dbd-fa7a-421c-9695-835950986cb0">Email text</=
li>
        <li data-uuid=3D"6b069c38-7a13-43e5-a607-a10a18ade2a2">Footers or d=
isclaimers including links etc,</li>
        <li data-uuid=3D"d4d5a28d-5213-435c-9f9e-4ad1647ac495">CX links (wi=
thout SSO) which allow users easy navigation and support CTA</li>
        <li data-uuid=3D"421a408a-867f-4577-abbe-d14c9d472fa4">Send dynamic=
 content or personalized content</li>
        <li data-uuid=3D"f48ffcc2-e71e-4beb-87c1-ddb942ae9c0b">Send client/=
account level information</li>
       </ul></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"eada3fe2-14b8-4362-ae11-6db1f904956d">Support analyt=
ics capabilities required - send rate, open rates, bounce rates, ability to=
 extract logs if needed</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"df4e43fa-4eb0-42e7-8327-1a300f5764e8">Self-serve cap=
ability to manage the template Lifecyle on T+0/T+1 (synchronization)=20
       <ul>
        <li data-uuid=3D"cf384002-f29a-4baa-ba56-b2b1623ebf9e">Self-serve c=
apability for NBIN Product &amp; support teams to define new templates</li>
        <li data-uuid=3D"0e459421-7005-4dd6-9982-31c973fba65c">Self-serve c=
apability for NBIN teams to edit or modify an existing template</li>
        <li data-uuid=3D"44b5cd97-377d-4de7-9eb2-898b3b1461f5">Self-serve c=
apability for NBIN teams to delete an existing template.</li>
       </ul></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"ed74d246-cdab-4452-bdf4-95647207c7ef">Ability to sen=
d bulk emails (same email content to multiple users ex: regulatory communic=
ation)</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"4cdcdde1-59ef-4612-8f6a-841c053411cf">Role based acc=
ess to templating tools and audit trails</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"00ffddf1-b3eb-41d4-a10c-dcca23bda722">Self serve bul=
k email capabilities which allow users sending ad-hoc bulk emails=20
       <ul>
        <li data-uuid=3D"e9a90742-f997-4e35-9046-ee73800e7aa7">Define targe=
t groups for ad-hoc email</li>
        <li data-uuid=3D"a18308a6-07c3-4af7-9472-32fe534b70e3">Allow templa=
te selection and addition of dynamic content</li>
        <li data-uuid=3D"e3de1905-5afd-4783-8f74-7038cdb207a8">Allow select=
ion of real time delivery or scheduled delivery</li>
       </ul></li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Th">Non-Functionals</th>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"29cb706e-0339-4e7c-8239-9615c7a54fb6">Best practices=
 based on architecture guidelines to ensure low spam rates - SPF, DKIM, DMA=
RC, rDNSm, Multipart MMIE format - <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https=
://www.twilio.com/en-us/blog/insights/10-tips-to-keep-email-out-of-the-spam=
-folder" rel=3D"nofollow">link</a> <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https=
://helpdesk.member365.com/hc/en-us/articles/360060886751-Guidelines-on-Bypa=
ssing-Email-Spam-Filters" rel=3D"nofollow">link2</a></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"29cb706e-0339-4e7c-8239-9615c7a54fb6">Templated to s=
upport capabilities &amp; best practices to meet accessibility standards - =
<a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://www.mailgun.com/blog/email/email=
s-not-dead-season-six-ep-2-why-accessibility-matters/" rel=3D"nofollow">lin=
k</a></li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"05a5be40-5b67-4f51-bc4d-fc4c6c53b95e">Email services=
 should support 5-6 times of current volumes which is around 120k emails pe=
r month.</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"167f94f9-25a1-4cc2-b194-c682f404072c">Email service =
should support 5X bilingual templates. (currently 25-20 templates exist)</l=
i>
      <li data-uuid=3D"ea8ee947-0f59-4f04-8898-04c40f062fdb">Email formats =
consistency across devices - desktop, tablet, mobile</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"a5716f10-e911-4118-bd02-ae68e6099145">Email format c=
onsistency across browsers - chrome, edge, safari</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"154708e3-ef7b-4a90-859a-8e0996770e34">Bank standards=
 - archival, data loss prevention etc,</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Th">Out of Scope</th>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"7f2a4d23-7fa8-4eae-bcd9-60aae7fa0fe5">Content manage=
ment decommission or client bulletins</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"991b78a9-417c-4e7c-a8dd-69d6ebed5abc">Future roadmap=
 items- email attachments, actual implementation of SMS and In-app channels=
, secured messaging</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"8879e034-c8b0-4f2b-9dd6-68f5de66d6fc">Notifications =
for NBF users is out of scope for this feature</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Th">Acceptance Criteria</th>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"fb66b961-dc21-4929-9e6e-2d631368e0e8">Successful int=
egration with email orchestration services</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"e0ee7ffd-7dcf-45ea-b581-61ddfaba79a3">Successful mig=
ration of all R2 templates and decommission of NPAT tool for email services=
</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"9027ac3d-0772-458c-8e12-3da0eecdb6ce">~100% send rat=
e; &lt;1% bounce rates for notifications triggered through the email servic=
e</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"0e977b82-9fb7-4964-a988-5a0b6b50cafc">Operationalize=
 new notifications onboarding with clear defined steps and responsibilities=
</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"ff8cb2ef-247a-4ae7-b32a-2cbd19805981">Operationalize=
 modifications or decommission of onboarded notifications for orchestration=
 with clear defined steps and responsibilities</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Th">Roadmap Dependencies</th>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"33438def-b5a7-42fa-9afa-cae80ed734d7">Dependency on =
Email subscription experience and Email Service integration to go live.</li=
>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Th">Risks &amp; Constraints</th>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"e0dc3d5c-0766-4b91-8782-0a59f7e7d269">Email service =
is yet to be finalized</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <th style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Th">Key Assumptions</th>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"b8a39163-f998-40ad-853d-b103f8667901">Multi-firm fea=
ture would be implemented in CX to ensure RR range consistencies between CX=
 and R2 profiles. This is required for successful migration of notification=
s to CX profile</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"44c46445-0993-492e-9614-fbc6c1dc9863">Email-id is co=
nsistent between R2 and CX user profiles and hence users will continue to r=
eceive emails on the same email id as they do today</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"6aad9a90-00b9-4c07-a6dc-072194bf94b0">Users with spe=
cialist roles in R2 can be identified in CX&nbsp;</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"a469b977-98f1-4f50-b6fb-23404b01ff13">This feature w=
ill provide common capabilities and services which will support future road=
map of additional channels and additional notifications</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
