<h1 id=3D"PRDUserNotificationsEmail-OperationalImpact&amp;Considerations">O=
perational Impact &amp; Considerations</h1>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"f152ac47-6eb9-4190-90f9-67123d8a83fc">Unified navigation =
is also in initial discovery stages - <a href=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca/spaces=
/COMPASS/pages/2748832515/PRD+Unified+Navigation+deep+linking+R2+features+i=
n+CX" rel=3D"nofollow">PRD Unified Navigation (deep linking R2 features in =
CX) - NBIN Product Team - Confluence</a></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"1ac43bef-a55b-4fc0-a30f-78dc00b3d41b">All discovery and d=
evelopment work should support the future Phase 2 requirements - Sms, in-ap=
p, target list self serve</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"7aaf3964-2a8b-463e-a1c0-688d05cfb1fe">Multi-firm feature =
is under implementation</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"866f392c-0987-4d89-a120-a43d599082ae">Third party emails =
are out of scope - user and account onboarding.</li>
</ul>
